2. REDISTRIBUTION IS NOT PERMITTED

You may not distribute, publish, sublicense, sell, or otherwise make available
this repository or any part of it — including any derivative, extract, or
reformatted version of the data — to any person or organization, by any means,
without prior written permission from the Principal Investigator.

This restriction is not a default. It is required by the terms of several
upstream data sources from which this repository is derived:

  - GADM permits academic and other non-commercial use, and requires
